{"title": "Legendary Action: Murderous Retort", "pageid": 31383, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp, /w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Legendary_Action_Offensive.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Murderous Retort</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> that lets its user use the Legendary Action <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Retort\" title=\"Murderous Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Murderous Retort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Main_Hand_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Murderous_Retort\" title=\"Murderous Retort\">Murderous Retort</a> to strike back at attackers.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per round, Orin or Sarevok can use their Legendary Action to immediately strike back at their attacker. \n</p><p>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Legacy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\">Deathbringer's Legacy</a> is active, they use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault (Sarevok)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer's Assault (Sarevok)</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault (Orin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer's Assault (Orin)</a> instead.\n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Murderous Retort </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Legendary_Action_Offensive_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Murderous_Retort_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Murderous Retort (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Murderous Retort</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Orin can immediately strike back at her attacker. If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Legacy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/54/Rage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer%27s_Legacy_(Condition)\" title=\"Deathbringer's Legacy (Condition)\">Deathbringer's Legacy</a> is active, she uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault (Orin)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault_(Orin)\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault (Orin)\">Deathbringer's Assault (Orin)</a> instead.</li>\n<li>Sarevok can immediately strike back at his attacker. If Deathbringer's Legacy is active, he uses <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Deathbringer's Assault\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Death_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Deathbringer_Assault\" title=\"Deathbringer Assault\">Deathbringer's Assault</a> instead.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Once per round, can use a Legendary Action to immediately strike back at their attacker.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202231\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.062 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1759/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21485/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8678/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 190/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 767691/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   53.785      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   53.785      1 -total\n 35.88%   19.297      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 31.89%   17.152      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.69%   15.970      5 Template:Icon_link\n 28.61%   15.387      5 Template:Icon_text\n 25.74%   13.844      3 Template:SAI\n 24.06%   12.940     12 Template:Trim\n 16.18%    8.703      5 Template:Ifempty\n 14.16%    7.615      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31383-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202231 and revision id 272567. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}